  {
    "start": 656.0,
    "end": 657.0,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 657.0,
    "end": 658.0,
    "text": " What were you doing?"
  },
  {
    "start": 658.0,
    "end": 659.0,
    "text": " What?"
  },
  {
    "start": 659.0,
    "end": 660.0,
    "text": " Nothing."
  },
  {
    "start": 660.0,
    "end": 661.0,
    "text": " Nothing."
  },
  {
    "start": 661.0,
    "end": 662.0,
    "text": " Nothing."
  },
  {
    "start": 662.0,
    "end": 669.82,
    "text": " Well, the connecting was more with the rocking, and the movement, and responding, and giving"
  },
  {
    "start": 669.82,
    "end": 676.84,
    "text": " you space, because in this one, you were actually responding pretty quickly most of the time."
  },
  {
    "start": 676.84,
    "end": 683.18,
    "text": " Sometimes with Pearl's, it was a much longer, 6, 10, 30 second delay."
  },
  {
    "start": 683.18,
    "end": 686.84,
    "text": " It's harder to pick up what the cues are, but it was working."
  },
  {
    "start": 686.84,
    "end": 688.4,
    "text": " That silence was giving you time to kind of process."
  },
  {
    "start": 688.4,
    "end": 689.4,
    "text": " And it did work."
  },
  {
    "start": 689.4,
    "end": 690.4,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 690.4,
    "end": 694.16,
    "text": " And it didn't feel like empty silence."
  },
  {
    "start": 694.16,
    "end": 695.9599999999999,
    "text": " It felt like connected silence."
  },
  {
    "start": 695.9599999999999,
    "end": 707.22,
    "text": " So if I have five ways to get things in my brain, what I see, what I hear, what I now"
  },
  {
    "start": 707.22,
    "end": 716.0,
    "text": " do this, what I feel, and then what I do with what I feel, those are now one and two."
  },
  {
    "start": 716.0,
    "end": 718.4,
    "text": " Those are not simultaneous anymore."
  },
  {
    "start": 718.4,
    "end": 719.4,
    "text": " When I feel something."
  },
  {
    "start": 719.4,
    "end": 725.16,
    "text": " When I feel something, my brain has to take in that data, maybe, maybe not process the"
  },
  {
    "start": 725.16,
    "end": 727.0799999999999,
    "text": " data and do something."
  },
  {
    "start": 727.0799999999999,
    "end": 733.86,
    "text": " Or if I'm doing something, I may or may not be aware of the sensation that doing is creating"
  },
  {
    "start": 733.86,
    "end": 742.06,
    "text": " for a bit, hence the reason why rocking, that rhythmic back and forth rocking, can help"
  },
  {
    "start": 742.06,
    "end": 748.96,
    "text": " me figure something out, what I taste or what I smell."
  },
  {
    "start": 748.96,
    "end": 755.72,
    "text": " How many of those do you think a pearl in the late state could possibly process at a"
  },
  {
    "start": 755.72,
    "end": 756.72,
    "text": " time?"
  },
  {
    "start": 756.72,
    "end": 757.72,
    "text": " One."
  },
  {
    "start": 757.72,
    "end": 758.72,
    "text": " One."
  },
  {
    "start": 758.72,
    "end": 759.72,
    "text": " Any one."
  },
  {
    "start": 759.72,
    "end": 760.72,
    "text": " Any one."
  },
  {
    "start": 760.72,
    "end": 761.72,
    "text": " Pick one."
  },
  {
    "start": 761.72,
    "end": 762.72,
    "text": " Any one of them."
  },
  {
    "start": 762.72,
    "end": 768.8000000000001,
    "text": " But I have to explore each one as a separate experience because my brain is so frayed and"
  },
  {
    "start": 768.8000000000001,
    "end": 775.96,
    "text": " so broken that it takes me a while to get one sensation in and figure it out if I ever"
  },
  {
    "start": 775.96,
    "end": 776.96,
    "text": " do figure it out."
  },
  {
    "start": 776.96,
    "end": 777.96,
    "text": " And then do something."
  },
  {
    "start": 777.96,
    "end": 778.96,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 778.96,
    "end": 779.96,
    "text": " Do something about."
  },
  {
    "start": 779.96,
    "end": 785.5600000000001,
    "text": " Like shifting my gaze, touching something and then starting to do something and maybe"
  },
  {
    "start": 785.5600000000001,
    "end": 787.22,
    "text": " overdoing it."
  },
  {
    "start": 787.22,
    "end": 789.72,
    "text": " So would you want to give me a real cat?"
  },
  {
    "start": 789.72,
    "end": 790.72,
    "text": " No."
  },
  {
    "start": 790.72,
    "end": 791.72,
    "text": " Probably not for me."
  },
  {
    "start": 791.72,
    "end": 793.94,
    "text": " It might be for some folks who just like to stroke."
  },
  {
    "start": 793.94,
    "end": 796.5600000000001,
    "text": " I like to do things with the cat."
  },
  {
    "start": 796.5600000000001,
    "end": 800.2,
    "text": " And unfortunately, that poor little kitty's ears are going to be ripped off as a real"
  },
  {
    "start": 800.2,
    "end": 801.2,
    "text": " kitty."
  },
  {
    "start": 801.2,
    "end": 804.0400000000001,
    "text": " That one's one of the best kitties for me."
  },
  {
    "start": 804.0400000000001,
    "end": 805.2,
    "text": " And I like to squeeze it."
  },
  {
    "start": 805.2,
    "end": 808.72,
    "text": " I like to squeeze the kitty because I like that pressure."
  },
  {
    "start": 808.72,
    "end": 811.1800000000001,
    "text": " Helping that kitty feel good."
  },
  {
    "start": 811.1800000000001,
    "end": 815.64,
    "text": " Heaven forbid a real cat would be in my house."
  },
  {
    "start": 815.64,
    "end": 817.64,
    "text": " So those kind of things."
  },
  {
    "start": 817.64,
    "end": 820.78,
    "text": " So that silence had value."
  },
  {
    "start": 820.78,
    "end": 826.52,
    "text": " It wasn't a silence that Melanie was just silent because she knew she had to be silent."
  },
  {
    "start": 826.52,
    "end": 837.48,
    "text": " She was using her silence to watch, to listen, to feel, to do, to maybe pay attention to"
  },
  {
    "start": 837.48,
    "end": 839.84,
    "text": " what it seemed like I was tasting or smelling."
  },
  {
    "start": 839.84,
    "end": 842.6,
    "text": " So it's a really critical time."
  },
  {
    "start": 842.6,
    "end": 845.94,
    "text": " But it wasn't silence because I'm thinking about what I've got to do next."
  },
  {
    "start": 845.94,
    "end": 846.94,
    "text": " No."
  },
  {
    "start": 846.94,
    "end": 847.94,
    "text": " It was very much a present silence."
  },
  {
    "start": 847.94,
    "end": 849.94,
    "text": " It was a responsive silence."
  },
  {
    "start": 849.94,
    "end": 850.94,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 850.94,
    "end": 852.02,
    "text": " Paying attention to me."
  },
  {
    "start": 852.02,
    "end": 857.16,
    "text": " So what we're going to do is we're going to take a look at what happens when Abby has"
  },
